{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07876","headline":"陪张丞相祠紫盖山途经玉泉寺 · 孟浩然","name":"陪张丞相祠紫盖山途经玉泉寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"望秩宣王命，斋心待漏行。\n青衿列胄子，从事有参卿。\n五马寻归路，双林指化城。\n闻钟度门近，照胆玉泉清。\n皁盖依松憩，缁徒拥锡迎。\n天宫上兜率，沙界豁迷明。\n欲就终焉志，恭闻智者名。\n人随逝水没，波逐覆舟倾。\n想像若在眼，周流空复情。\n谢公还欲卧，谁与济苍生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07876.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07876","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}